WEBVTT

00:02:27.329 --> 00:02:30.371
You might think that training
neural networks to recognize these

00:02:30.413 --> 00:02:32.371
would be a long and complicated task

00:02:32.413 --> 00:02:35.746
until you realize just 
how much data is out there

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:38.829
and how quickly modern
computers can process it.

00:02:39.163 --> 00:02:41.163
From social media posts,

00:02:41.204 --> 00:02:42.871
uploaded photos and videos,

00:02:42.913 --> 00:02:44.121
and phone recordings,

00:02:44.163 --> 00:02:46.704
to heat-sensitive security cameras

00:02:46.746 --> 00:02:50.121
and wearables that monitor
physiological signs,

00:02:50.163 --> 00:02:52.579
the big question is not
how to collect enough data,

00:02:52.621 --> 00:02:55.163
but what we're going to do with it.

00:02:55.246 --> 00:02:58.704
There are plenty of beneficial uses
for computerized emotion recognition.

00:02:58.746 --> 00:03:03.121
Robots using algorithms
to identify facial expressions